da012c9348570ee8e4b78ec10c3f9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dd79d7e6/uploads/origins/68f95c1d-f5c8-4a6e-95b5-168b7f731d6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9da012c9348570ee8e4b78ec10c3f9e, https://si.imgix.net/dd79d7e6/uploads/origins/68f95c1d-f5c8-4a6e-95b5-168b7f731d6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5bed0f668f0892876f449b09be089f2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dd79d7e6/uploads/origins/68f95c1d-f5c8-4a6e-95b5-168b7f731d6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0045028f48891673d1c7f24d0b1ee75 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I was hoping to see if I could get a picture of my old fox lady Matsu.\n\nRef: https://imgur.com/a/matsu-NAufDXJ\n\nAs for the subject of the image, I was hoping for her to be standing in the middle of a tavern holding some ale in one hand as she's telling stories to and laughing with a crowd around her, having a good time and in high spirits. Maybe have some of the crowd feeling tired as she has been laughing and telling stories for hours to the point of just rambling.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/matsu-NAufDXJ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@squarewave29/works/276", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/031ad1df/uploads/origins/c97949b8-bebf-46f1-83c1-d2687dd8e6d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d79b0743ba780246c70011bba34555d1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/031ad1df/uploads/origins/c97949b8-bebf-46f1-83c1-d2687dd8e6d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d79b0743ba780246c70011bba34555d1, https://si.imgix.net/031ad1df/uploads/origins/c97949b8-bebf-46f1-83c1-d2687dd8e6d8?bg=%23fff&auto=fo